{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19237","headline":"和仆射牛相公寓言二首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"和仆射牛相公寓言二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心如止水鉴常明，见尽人间万物情。\n鵰鹗腾空犹逞俊，骅骝啮足自无惊。\n时来未觉权爲祟，贵了方知退是荣。\n只恐重重世缘在，事须三度副苍生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}